rapid recharging and would need more than a full day of ideal sunlight to refill the battery, so it is best treated as a top-up option. The article recommends the deal for dependable outage backup, while noting that the model itself has not been tested; the recommendation draws on EcoFlow\u2019s track record and tests of other products. Buyers should also consider its weight and that it is sold and shipped by a Best Buy marketplace seller.","ref_id":{"turn_index":299411,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":12},"pub_date":1793388756.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/TqS8mWtqd42QHTVlanp7pb26hByPnNtW3OhngSl6V7jsfMgNOID1f4Ikd28dJX3Fabf9I0lrWXg-Fw0ggkmzsDtSIPcBaHD9fI-nb9VvsR5W2bqdpbQB4hZjX0hkD3nh","attribution":"www.techradar.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techradar.com/pro/small-lightweight-portable-yet-powerful-bluetti-elite-100-v2-solar-generator-bundle-provides-emergency-backup-at-home-and-portable-power-on-the-road-and-its-43-percent-cheaper-right-now","title":"'Small, lightweight, portable yet powerful': Bluetti Elite 100 V2 solar generator bundle provides emergency backup at home and portable power on the road and it's 43% cheaper right now","snippet":"The Bluetti Elite 100 V2 solar generator bundle is discounted at Amazon to $629, down $470\u2014or about 43%\u2014from its $1,099 list price. The package includes a 1,024Wh LiFePO4 power station and a 100W solar panel, making it suitable for home emergency backup, camping, and road trips. The 25-pound unit provides 1,800W of continuous AC output, can power up to 11 devices, supports UPS switching within 10 milliseconds, and is rated for more than 4,000 battery cycles. AC charging reaches 80% in approximately 45 minutes and full capacity in about 70 minutes, while the included panel takes roughly seven hours under favorable conditions. Reviewers praise its portability, quiet operation, app, and high output. However, the current price is $79 above its previous Black Friday low of $55